# Scratch workspace
Scratch/

# Graphify architecture-graph snapshots. Generated by `graphify update .`
# (no LLM needed) and rebuilt from source, so they are never committed: 8 MB
# of HTML/JSON would otherwise churn on every regeneration. The interactive
# view is published to GitHub Pages by `.github/workflows/pages.yml`.
graphify-out/
